id=noota
name=NoOTA (block system updates)
version=v1.0
versionCode=1
author=Hacktimepixel
description=Hard-blocks automatic system OTA updates on Pixel: disables GMS update components (SystemUpdateService/Listener/GcmTaskService/Activities), sets ota_disable_automatic_update=1, stops update_engine at each boot. Fully reversible: uninstall.sh re-enables everything from state file. Mainline/Play system updates unaffected.
